विस्मयो मे महान्‍राजन्हृष्यामि च पुन: पुन: ॥ ७७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4896,\"bb\":4281,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/77/b4281/\",\"body_value\":\"tac ca saṁsmṛtya saṁsmṛtya
rūpam aty-adbhutaṁ hareḥ
