hṛṣyāmi ca punaḥ punaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4897,\"bb\":4282,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/77/b4282/\",\"shadow_value\":\"tat – that; ca – also; saṁsmṛtya – remembering; saṁsmṛtya – remembering; rūpam – form; ati – greatly; adbhutam – wonderful; hareḥ – of Lord Kṛṣṇa; vismayaḥ – wonder; me – my; mahān – great; rājan – O King; hṛṣyāmi – I am enjoying; ca – also; punaḥ punaḥ – repeatedly.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"tat\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"saṁsmṛtya\",\"translation\":\"remembering\"},{\"word\":\"saṁsmṛtya\",\"translation\":\"remembering\"},{\"word\":\"rūpam\",\"translation\":\"form\"},{\"word\":\"ati\",\"translation\":\"greatly\"},{\"word\":\"adbhutam\",\"translation\":\"wonderful\"},{\"word\":\"hareḥ\",\"translation\":\"of Lord Kṛṣṇa\"},{\"word\":\"vismayaḥ\",\"translation\":\"wonder\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"my\"},{\"word\":\"mahān\",\"translation\":\"great\"},{\"word\":\"rājan\",\"translation\":\"O King\"},{\"word\":\"hṛṣyāmi\",\"translation\":\"I am enjoying\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"punaḥ punaḥ\",\"translation\":\"repeatedly\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4898,\"bb\":4283,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/77/b4283/\",\"body_value\":\"O King, as I remember the wonderful form of Lord Kṛṣṇa, I am struck with wonder more and more, and I rejoice again and again.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4899,\"bb\":4284,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/77/b4284/\",\"body_value\":\"It appears that Sañjaya also, by the grace of Vyāsa, could see the universal form Kṛṣṇa exhibited to Arjuna. It is, of co